[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m    - A and C are descendants of B.  
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m    - So, A:1, C:1.  
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m    - D is not a descendant of B (since there is no path from B to D in the graph).  
