[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m    - A is a descendant of C.  
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m    - B and D are not descendants of C.  
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m    - Therefore, the observed result A:1, B:0, C:0, D:0 is **consistent**.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m 
