[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m   - C -> D  
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m   - D -> B  
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m   - So B and D are downstream of C.  
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m   - Thus, B:1, D:1.  
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m   - A is not downstream of C, so A:0.  
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m   - Result: A:0, B:1, C:0, D:1 → **Consistent**.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m 
