[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m - **D->A** and **D->C** imply that **A** and **C** are descendants of **D**.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m - **D->C** implies that **C** is a descendant of **D**.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m - **D->A** implies that **A** is a descendant of **D**.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m So, **A**, **B**, and **C** are descendants of **D**.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m Thus:
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m - **A:1**, **B:1**, **C:1**, **D:0** is **consistent**.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m ---
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m ### **Conclusion
