[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m - **A is perturbed**: A = 0  
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m - **B**: Is B a downstream descendant of A?  
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m   - A -> B → Yes. So B = 1  
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m - **C**: Is C a downstream descendant of A?  
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m   - A does not have an edge to C. So C = 0  
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m - **D**: Is D a downstream descendant of A?  
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m   - A does not have an edge to D. So D = 0  
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m **Result**: A:0, B:1, C:0, D:0 ✅
