[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m - B is downstream of D → B:1
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m - C is downstream of D? No (D->B, no edge from D to C)
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m - So C:0
