[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m But in this case, B is not perturbed, so it's not 0. However, we need to check whether the values of the other nodes (A, C, D) are consistent with the graph.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m - A is not perturbed, so it must be 1 if it is downstream of no one. But since no one is upstream of A, it's not affected by any perturbation. So A is 1 (as it is not perturbed, but in the graph, it's not reachable from any node, so it's not affected).
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m - C is not perturbed, so it must be 1 (as it's not reachable from any node).
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m - D is not perturbed, so it must be 1 (as it's not reachable from any node).
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m 
