[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m - A:1 (since it's not perturbed, but it's not reachable from any node)
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m - B:0 (since it's not perturbed)
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m - C:1 (since it's not perturbed)
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m - D:1 (since it's not perturbed)
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m But the perturbation observation says:
