[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m This is **inconsistent** with the graph. Because, according to the graph, A, C, D are not reachable from any node (except D, which is reachable from C). But since B is not perturbed, it's not affected. However, the perturbation observation says A, C, D are all 0. But according to the graph, they should all be 1 (since they are not reachable from any node). So this is inconsistent.
