[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m - A is 0 (no change). All other nodes are 0.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m - The graph has no edges pointing to A, so A is not influenced by any perturbation.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m - B is not a descendant of A (since B->A is the reverse of what we want, and we follow arrows only left-to-right; so A->B would be the correct direction, but B->A is the reverse).
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m - So, B is not reachable from A in the graph. Therefore, B should be 0, which matches the observation.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m 
