[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m - A is 1 because B->A. So A is reachable from B.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m - C is not reachable from B (no edge from B to C), so C is 0.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m - D is not reachable from B (no edge from B to D), so D is 0.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m - This matches the observation: A=1, B=0, C=0, D=0.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m **Case 3: Perturb(D) → A:1, B:1, C:1, D:0**
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m 
