[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m - B is reachable from D (D->B), so B is 1.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m - C is reachable from D (D->C), so C is 1.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m - A is reachable from B (B->A), so A is 1.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m - D is 0, which matches the observation.
