[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m - Perturbed node is **B**, which is 0.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m - B's outgoing edges are B->A and B->D.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m - So A and D are downstream of B.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m - Therefore, A and D are 1, B is 0, C is 0.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m - So the result is: A:1, B:0, C:0, D:1 — matches the observation. ✅
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m ---
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m ### Perturbation: C -> A:0, B:0, C:0, D:1
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m - Perturbed node is **C**, which is 0.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m - C's outgoing edge is C->D.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m - So D is downstream of C.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m - Therefore, D is 1, others are 0.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m - So the result is: A:0, B:0, C:0, D:1 — matches the observation. ✅
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m ---
