[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m - Perturbed node is **D**, which is 0.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m - D has no outgoing edges (no edges from D).
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m - So no downstream descendants of D.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m - Therefore, all nodes are 0.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m - So the result is: A:0, B:0, C:0, D:0 — matches the observation. ✅
