[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m - A is not affected (since A is not a descendant of C; A is upstream of C)
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m - B is not affected (since B is not a descendant of C)
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m - D is not a descendant of C (no path from C to D)
