[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m - A is not affected (no path from D to A)
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m - B is not affected (no path from D to B)
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m - C is a descendant of D? No, because there is no edge from D to C. D is not a parent of C.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m 
