[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m - B->A: B is not perturbed → B:0
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m - D->B: D is not perturbed → D:0
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m So the result should be: A:1, B:0, C:0, D:0 (consistent with the given result)
