[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m ### Step 1: Understand the perturbation rules
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m - **Perturbed node is 0**
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m - **Downstream descendants of the perturbed node are 1**
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m - All other nodes are 0
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m So, if we perturb a node, we set it to 0, and then look for all downstream descendants (i.e., nodes reachable from it by following the edges) to be 1.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m ---
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m 
