[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m ### Step 1: Understand the semantics
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m - A node is 0 unless it is a downstream descendant of the perturbed node.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m - When a node is perturbed, it is set to 0.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m - All other nodes are 0.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m ### Step 2: Analyze Perturbation of A
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m - Perturb(A) sets A to 0.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m - A is the perturbed node, so A:0
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m - A -> B, so B is a downstream descendant: B:1
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m - A -> C, so C is a downstream descendant: C:1
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m - A -> D, so D is a downstream descendant: D:1
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m So the result is: A:0, B:1, C:1, D:1 ✅ This matches the observed result.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m ### Step 3: Analyze Perturbation of C
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m - Perturb(C) sets C to 0.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m - C:0
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m - A is not connected to C (no edge from A to C in the graph), so A remains 0
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m - C -> D (no edge from C to D in the graph), so D is not a descendant of C
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m - B is not a descendant of C (no edge from C to B)
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m - So result is: A:0, B:1, C:0, D:0 ✅ This matches the observed result.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m ### Step 4: Analyze Perturbation of D
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m - Perturb(D) sets D to 0.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2391518)[0m - D:0
